WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.700
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.401
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.401 --> 00:00:03.203
We hope you're doing well

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:04.103
and now, if you don't mind,

00:00:04.103 --> 00:00:05.504
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.504 --> 00:00:09.008
Amid tensions over possible
military action in Ukraine,

00:00:09.008 --> 00:00:11.844
President Biden will meet
on a video call tomorrow

00:00:11.844 --> 00:00:13.680
with Russian
President Vladimir Putin

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.581
because there's
no better deterrent

00:00:15.581 --> 00:00:18.852
than a long video call
with a 79-year-old man.

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:19.785
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.785 --> 00:00:20.486
[ As Putin ]
You know, what?

00:00:20.486 --> 00:00:21.888
This is not worth it.

00:00:21.888 --> 00:00:23.689
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.689 --> 00:00:25.358
CNN announced over the weekend

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:27.460
that it has terminated
host Chris Cuomo

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:28.861
and, if you're wondering
what you have to do

00:00:28.861 --> 00:00:30.763
to get fired from CNN,

00:00:30.763 --> 00:00:32.831
Jeffrey Toobin
still works there.

00:00:32.831 --> 00:00:34.901
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:40.173 --> 00:00:41.708
And, if you don't know it, uh,

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:42.976
don't Google it.

00:00:42.976 --> 00:00:44.978
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.978 --> 00:00:46.712
The Biden administration
announced today

00:00:46.712 --> 00:00:48.081
that the U.S. will stage

00:00:48.081 --> 00:00:51.751
a diplomatic boycott
of the 2022 Beijing Olympics

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:54.253
and, in retaliation,
China announced

00:00:54.253 --> 00:00:57.089
that the iPhone 14
is going to look like this.

00:00:57.089 --> 00:01:00.192
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:00.192 --> 00:01:02.529
Arizona Senator Kyrsten Sinema
announced,

00:01:02.529 --> 00:01:04.464
in an Instagram Story
over the weekend,

00:01:04.464 --> 00:01:05.965
that she had
officially qualified

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:07.567
for the upcoming
Boston marathon.

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:09.902
But, fair warning
to the other runners --

00:01:09.902 --> 00:01:12.104
she loves holding things up
at the finish line.

00:01:12.104 --> 00:01:13.339
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:15.908
In a recent interview,
actor George Clooney said

00:01:15.908 --> 00:01:18.077
that he turned down $35 million

00:01:18.077 --> 00:01:19.645
to appear
in an airline commercial

00:01:19.645 --> 00:01:21.847
because the carrier
was associated

00:01:21.847 --> 00:01:25.117
with a country that does not
have a good human rights record.

00:01:25.117 --> 00:01:26.785
Is it American?

00:01:26.785 --> 00:01:29.989
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:32.525
New York Mayor Bill de Blasio
announced today

00:01:32.525 --> 00:01:34.560
that all private employers
in the city

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:35.761
will soon be required

00:01:35.761 --> 00:01:38.765
to mandate coronavirus
vaccinations for workers.

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:42.134 line:0%
Otherwise, it's back to remote
work for Times Square Elmo.

00:01:42.134 --> 00:01:44.470 line:7%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:47.039
I don't think Times Square Elmo

00:01:47.039 --> 00:01:50.510
has a plant in his office.

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:54.414
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.414 --> 00:01:56.149
I don't think that's real,
Shoemaker.

00:01:56.149 --> 00:01:58.550
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:00.653
The New York Times
published a report yesterday

00:02:00.653 --> 00:02:03.155
detailing a series
of coronavirus infections

00:02:03.155 --> 00:02:05.558
stemming
from an animé convention

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:06.792
held last month in New York.

00:02:06.792 --> 00:02:08.427
Well, something tells me

00:02:08.427 --> 00:02:10.029
they'll be fine
with quarantining.

00:02:10.029 --> 00:02:12.731
"Oh, you want me to stay
inside for 10 days?

00:02:12.731 --> 00:02:14.100
Not a problem."

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:17.904
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.904 --> 00:02:21.006
According to the latest numbers,
the average cost per day

00:02:21.006 --> 00:02:23.242
for a rental car
during the holiday season

00:02:23.242 --> 00:02:26.345
is up by 75%, compared to 2019.

00:02:26.345 --> 00:02:28.615
Even worse, they consider this

00:02:28.615 --> 00:02:30.483
a Chevy Malibu, or similar.

00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:32.752
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:42.628
And, finally, a man in Italy
reportedly wore

00:02:42.628 --> 00:02:44.997
a fake silicone arm last week

00:02:44.997 --> 00:02:47.900
to avoid getting
the coronavirus vaccine.

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:49.168
And wait 'til you hear how he

00:02:49.168 --> 00:02:50.570
got out of his vasectomy.

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:52.138
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.138 --> 00:02:53.438
[ Italian accent ]
Mamma mia!

00:02:53.438 --> 00:02:55.275
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:55.275 --> 00:02:57.276
That was a monologue, everybody!

00:02:57.276 --> 00:02:58.611
[ Cheering and applause ]
Oh, man.

